    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7e362aed18e4894ebbe2932",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“一出道就拿下二连胜！因她血统优良，\n原本就广受期待，而她在比赛上的表现\n也证实了其潜能完全不辜负血统──”",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c88fd8b614bf01a2548bf94f3926f2f63b2f534c0125e25b4045f72da53b517",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
