      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047102.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        64,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/64/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:242551c3094c16f170b582af",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "去年荒漠英雄也同样出色地跑完了所有比赛，\n然而面对此情势，\n她却无法获得媒体的特别关注……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb1ac8a0cd7d9f3ff1396c464beb3d7487c84eae0c3c5ebe9f364993ff56558e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047102.json",
      "json_path": [
