    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ba434af4af4e4af2a9a9678",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……嗯。\n我很庆幸今天能跟训练员一起去新年参拜。\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "aabdaca181812bf2f2112df6a0438b446b7dabd840cf917448046afa60b7628a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
