    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccd850837de552d15344bad8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我既不起眼又没有存在感，但正因如此……\n我想继续扎实地努力，免得被伟大的前辈们\n与势不可挡的后辈们掩盖了光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7556c220a4450ca23f7cf91065b6dcb6f6df57e577b5c06fcb0992f4613e2195",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047102.json",
      "json_path": [
