    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86cac0ce9aef36a1c6d2b713",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“我终于迎接了出道后的第三年……\n进入古马级了呢。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "46e545b6b2be19d6da7c4bf8ff5adda105da3a6d79d8208187c28c29607a9874",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047102.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b4cda27453de87c5d0d6598",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaf6b29d17c0d17b31649773a41c9995f963b5bb8c45fb8d89c79c740e5bc158",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047102.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        70,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/70/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:993ac403baf3e7eb750d8f40",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想我一定是个固执的人，\n甚至固执得有点丢人。",
